      "description": "At 4 life in a critical position, Haiku Perfect activated Urza's Factory before playing Urza's Mine from hand. Playing the land first would have made Ulvenwald Hydra 9/9 instead of 8/8 (its P/T equals lands controlled), and provided additional mana for Golem Artisan activations to pump creatures or grant evasion. The land drop is free and strictly improves the board before committing mana to Factory.",
