    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 4 life facing Rampaging Baloths 6/6 (which generates 4/4 tokens on landfall) plus an existing 4/4 Beast token, creating a 2/2 Assembly-Worker is far less impactful than using Universal Solvent to destroy Rampaging Baloths. The Baloths is the most dangerous threat both as a 6/6 trampler and as a token generator. A 2/2 token barely helps with blocking when the opponent has 6/6 trample.",
